From fe7923fb876c895393b89f988c52d8171a9e0a47 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ArifiLabs <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 02:58:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] release-prep phase 4: a real fork of ggml-org at b10825,
 internal material out of history

The rewrite is restricted to the fork range 9e0e22059..export, so every upstream commit keeps
its own sha and its signature and the published history shares an ancestor with ggml-org.

- the 133 internal documents and the 436 lane evidence files are removed from every commit in
  the range, not deleted by a later one: they are absent from history and from patches/.
- NOTICE and licenses/ name cli11, fmt, googletest and perfetto, carried with PowerInfer/libaz,
  and perfetto ships no licence of its own so the Apache-2.0 text is retained here.
- the receipts name the class of a scrubbed value, never the literal.
- the reach is stated before the percentages in all three documents; the duplicate
  GGML_ARIFI_Q6K_MMVQ registry row is gone; the evidence manifest says which headline numbers
  have no shipped receipt.
- the sha-pinned ledgers are re-keyed once from the commit-map; the base pin is NOT re-keyed,
  because the base did not move.

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - release engineering for this fork; no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED - documents, licences and audit ledgers only; no code path is touched.
