ilent wrong math rather than a crash.<br>**One unexplained measurement, kept rather than smoothed:** *prompt* at 4 rows collapses to `174.63` from `310.85` (tight range, not noise) while 8 rows returns to `291.12` — non-monotonic and not accounted for. The prediction that prompt would be flat was wrong: `should_use_mmvq` also returns true for `n > 1`, so this pipeline serves small batches and does touch prefill. Evidence: `research/local-inference/trial-evidence/110/g128-kernels/rows/` and `.../mmvq/`. |
